eckSelfPermission(requireContext(),Manifest.permission.ACCESS_COARSE_LOCATION)==PackageManager.PERMISSION_GRANTED||ContextCompat.checkSelfPermission(requireContext(),Manifest.permission.ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION)==PackageManager.PERMISSION_GRANTED;}\n"
